-- F-kids StatePF walk: port of Tools.ShippingGen4KWalkTranslate to `KeepsCS` (the K walk with the circuit state tracked). Takes `MemoFamily` as a HYPOTHESIS `M`; adds NO premise, NO law, NO axiom. No `sorry`, no `native_decide`. Generated by renaming, then fixed by hand where the state matters.
-- `translateStepWith`) and the fuel induction, with `StableK` instead of `StableA` (copies of ShippingChildTranslateA 399-525).

